id-zuepckvj>In the last week your analyst reruns everything while we watch and answer questions. Ninety days later we come back for a full day, at no charge, to check that the numbers still hold up in your hands and in your tools.</p></li></ol></div><div class="process-side" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-zuepckvj><div class="process-orbits" data-follow="500" data-astro-cid-zuepckvj><svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="orbits process-rings" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce><g class="orbits-turn" style="transform-origin: 200px 200px; transform-box: view-box" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce><g class="orbit-ring" style="transform-origin:200.0px 204.0px;transform-box:view-box;--dur:70s;--dir:normal" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce><circle cx="200.0" cy="204.0" r="150" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce></circle><circle cx="148.7" cy="63.0" r="5" class="orbit-dot" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce></circle></g><g class="orbit-ring" style="transform-origin:205.0px 198.0px;transform-box:view-box;--dur:90s;--dir:reverse" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce><circle cx="205.0" cy="198.0" r="156" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce></circle></g><g class="orbit-ring" style="transform-origin:210.0px 196.0px;transform-box:view-box;--dur:120s;--dir:normal" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce><circle cx="210.0" cy="196.0" r="162" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="2 5" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce></circle><circle cx="154.6" cy="348.2" r="5" class="orbit-dot" data-astro-cid-myoo3rce></circle></g></g></svg></div></div></section>
